    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26307" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Leprĕum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Leprĕon</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Leprĭon</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Leprĭum</span></b> ), i, n., and
